# Test Plan: HR Leave Management System

## 1. Introduction
Tester: Mivuyo Kalolo | Date: 24/11/2026 | App: Python CLI + SQLite
Purpose: verify leave requests, balances, and login work correctly.

## 2. Scope
In scope: login, apply for leave, approve/reject leave, balance updates, data saved in the database.
Out of scope: performance, load, and UI design testing.

## 3. Test Approach
- Functional testing
- Boundary value analysis and equivalence partitioning
- Negative and input validation testing
- Basic security checks (wrong passwords, role access)
- Automated unit tests with pytest

## 4. Test Environment
OS: macOS  | Python: 26.10.0 | Database: SQLite
Tools: DB Browser for SQLite, GitHub, pytest

## 5. Entry Criteria
App runs and every menu option has been explored.

## 6. Exit Criteria
All high-priority test cases executed and all defects logged.

## 7. Risks
- No documentation or requirements available
- Business rules may need to be assumed

## 8. Deliverables
Test cases, bug reports, automation scripts, summary report.

## 9. Defect Severity
- Critical: app crashes or data is corrupted
- Major: a main feature gives wrong results
- Minor: small or cosmetic issue
